         ${misc:Depends}
Description: Lugh design system for Qt Quick (Lugh.UI)
 The Lugh.UI QML module: theme tokens, glass panels, buttons, menus, sliders
 and the other controls shared by the Lugh shell, the greeter and Lugh apps,
 with the Lucide icon font. Installed as a QML import tree under
 /usr/share/lugh/qml.
